# Her Memories: Of Malign Maladies (crystalWar 72), the fourth fragment: a level 99 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria with
# the WotG mission Her Memories current (a GM) and Large Memory Fragments 1, 3 and 4 (GMs). Amaura 955, finished: begun;
# Prog 3 and the Fey Stone (GMs). Southern San d'Oria [S]: Raustigne 169, finished: completed (Large Memory Fragment 2),
# checkMemoryFragments (four large: REPORT_TO_CAIT_SITH (Southern San d'Oria [S]'s text, messageName, no entity), Her
# Memories completed, Forget Me Not current), the Fey Stone taken.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Amaura/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/955 SouthernSanDoriaS/Raustigne/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/169
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-82.867,-6.949,91.148 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Wotg HerMemories current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment1               # a GM
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment3               # a GM
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment4               # a GM
login
trigger Amaura                          # available, Her Memories current: 955 (8 args)
finish                                  # begun
charvar Quest[7][72]Prog 3              # a GM
keyitem FeyStone                        # a GM
warp 5.479,-1.999,44.456 SouthernSanDoriaS
trigger Raustigne                       # the Fey Stone: 169 (8 args)
finish                                  # completed (Large Memory Fragment 2); four large: REPORT_TO_CAIT_SITH; Her Memories completed; the Fey Stone taken
